Changes: the Go gopher is scaled down and moved to the lower left, the build
mark or the test mark is scaled down and moved to the upper right, and each pair
is combined into one 16x16 icon. The files without a suffix use the colors of
the light sources and the -dark files use the colors of the _dark sources. The
paths are otherwise unchanged.
